0..74 Comment "// `exit.gandr`\'s handlers written by hand as the kernel replays them: the"
75..169 Comment "// handled body as a tree over `std.process.Exit.Eff`\'s one operation, the free model, and the"
170..243 Comment "// handler as a fold of the tree. A deep handler reinstalls itself in the"
244..322 Comment "// continuation, so the fold\'s clause resumes by folding what the continuation"
323..334 Comment "// answers."
